# Keep everything LF in the repo.
#
# This matters for extension/filters/*.txt specifically: the sha256 recorded in
# filters/lists.json is computed over LF-normalised text by tools/update_lists.py,
# and letting Git rewrite those files to CRLF on checkout would make the recorded
# checksums describe content that is not what is on disk.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
